  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Dependencies**\n\nI\'m currently evaluating the required packages for a real-time, anonymous, multimedia chat application. My focus is on robust WebSocket libraries; `ws` is under consideration, but I\'m also leaning towards `socket.io` for its potential ease of implementation. I need to make a decision soon and ensure all functionality can be implemented.\n\n\n**Refining Feature Scope**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the feature set for this anonymous chat application. `types/ws` seems very promising for managing WebSockets. WebRTC\'s `RTCPeerConnection` simplifies audio/video/screen sharing. I\'m exploring the Web Audio API for voice filters to enhance anonymity. Canvas filters and avatar options are also being considered. Instant match functionality for random strangers is now being fleshed out.\n\n\n"
