  planner_response {
    response: "I have built **Incognito: Anonymous Chat & Call**, a privacy-first, real-time communication platform equipped with peer-to-peer audio, video, screen sharing, ephemeral messaging, and creative privacy filters:\n\n- **Anonymous Identity Engine**: Automatically generates unique, zero-trace pseudonyms with custom geometric SVG avatar masks, instant profile regenerators, and no account requirements.\n- **Matchmaking & Private Rooms**:\n  - **Random Stranger Match**: Pairs users instantly with interest tag filters (Tech, Philosophy, Gaming, Late Night, Confessions, etc.) and seamless skip/next transitions.\n  - **Secret Room Codes**: Create or join encrypted rooms using custom or auto-generated codes.\n  - **Phantom AI Companion**: An intelligent incognito conversational partner for solo chat, debate practice, and deep discussions.\n- **Real-Time Voice Calling & Voice Disguiser**: Features live audio wave meters and real-time Web Audio API pitch modulation presets (Deep Bass, Helium, Cyber Robot, Whisper Spy, Walkie-Talkie).\n- **Video Calling & Privacy Filters**: Hardware-accelerated canvas filter pipeline to anonymize video streams with Privacy Face Blur, Cyber Hologram scanlines, Night Vision, Mosaic Pixelation, Matrix Code, and Noir B&W.\n- **Screen Sharing**: Broadcast applications, browser tabs, or entire desktops directly to peers over P2P WebRTC channels.\n- **Ephemeral Encrypted Chat**: Self-destructing message timers (5s, 10s, 30s), voice notes, spoiler-blurred image sharing, real-time typing indicators, and instant AI icebreaker prompts.\n- **Collaborative Whiteboard & Soundboard**: Real-time collaborative sketch canvas with PNG export, plus instant synthesized audio triggers (applause, drumroll, laser, mystery chimes)."
    thinking: "**Verifying Project Requirements**\n\nOkay, so I\'ve confirmed that the initial linting and compilation steps for the applet were successful. Now, I\'m taking a fresh look at the user\'s request. Specifically, I\'m making sure I understand the core features: an anonymous chat app, along with voice/video call and screen sharing capabilities, plus any \"other\" potential features. I need to make sure I don\'t overlook any implied requirements.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built **Incognito: Anonymous Chat & Call**, a privacy-first, real-time communication platform equipped with peer-to-peer audio, video, screen sharing, ephemeral messaging, and creative privacy filters:\n\n- **Anonymous Identity Engine**: Automatically generates unique, zero-trace pseudonyms with custom geometric SVG avatar masks, instant profile regenerators, and no account requirements.\n- **Matchmaking & Private Rooms**:\n  - **Random Stranger Match**: Pairs users instantly with interest tag filters (Tech, Philosophy, Gaming, Late Night, Confessions, etc.) and seamless skip/next transitions.\n  - **Secret Room Codes**: Create or join encrypted rooms using custom or auto-generated codes.\n  - **Phantom AI Companion**: An intelligent incognito conversational partner for solo chat, debate practice, and deep discussions.\n- **Real-Time Voice Calling & Voice Disguiser**: Features live audio wave meters and real-time Web Audio API pitch modulation presets (Deep Bass, Helium, Cyber Robot, Whisper Spy, Walkie-Talkie).\n- **Video Calling & Privacy Filters**: Hardware-accelerated canvas filter pipeline to anonymize video streams with Privacy Face Blur, Cyber Hologram scanlines, Night Vision, Mosaic Pixelation, Matrix Code, and Noir B&W.\n- **Screen Sharing**: Broadcast applications, browser tabs, or entire desktops directly to peers over P2P WebRTC channels.\n- **Ephemeral Encrypted Chat**: Self-destructing message timers (5s, 10s, 30s), voice notes, spoiler-blurred image sharing, real-time typing indicators, and instant AI icebreaker prompts.\n- **Collaborative Whiteboard & Soundboard**: Real-time collaborative sketch canvas with PNG export, plus instant synthesized audio triggers (applause, drumroll, laser, mystery chimes)."
