  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the shareable private room link system with instant 1-click joining and real-time WebRTC communication:\n\n- **Shareable Invite Links & URL Detection**:\n  - Automatically generates shareable room links (e.g. `?room=ANON-8921` and `/room/ANON-8921`).\n  - When a user opens an invite link, the application automatically detects the target room code, presents an **Invite Link Detected** banner, pre-populates the room code, and allows joining the encrypted session in one click.\n  - Browser URL automatically synchronizes with active room states and clears upon leaving.\n\n- **Invite & Sharing Controls**:\n  - **Lobby**: Live preview of the room invite URL with 1-click **Copy Link** and **Web Share API** integrations.\n  - **In-Call Controls**: Dedicated **Invite Link** badges and buttons on the top bar and in the control dock.\n  - **Invite Modal**: Quick link copying, social sharing (WhatsApp, Telegram), and interactive QR code rendering for mobile device scanning.\n  - **Waiting Room State**: An active waiting indicator for the room creator with instant copy-to-clipboard CTA while awaiting peer arrival.\n\n- **WebRTC Signaling & Production Architecture**:\n  - Synchronized WebRTC offer/answer signaling and ICE candidate routing between room initiator and joiner.\n  - Added `vercel.json` SPA rewrites and server-side route fallbacks for production deployment on Vercel."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the shareable private room link system with instant 1-click joining and real-time WebRTC communication:\n\n- **Shareable Invite Links & URL Detection**:\n  - Automatically generates shareable room links (e.g. `?room=ANON-8921` and `/room/ANON-8921`).\n  - When a user opens an invite link, the application automatically detects the target room code, presents an **Invite Link Detected** banner, pre-populates the room code, and allows joining the encrypted session in one click.\n  - Browser URL automatically synchronizes with active room states and clears upon leaving.\n\n- **Invite & Sharing Controls**:\n  - **Lobby**: Live preview of the room invite URL with 1-click **Copy Link** and **Web Share API** integrations.\n  - **In-Call Controls**: Dedicated **Invite Link** badges and buttons on the top bar and in the control dock.\n  - **Invite Modal**: Quick link copying, social sharing (WhatsApp, Telegram), and interactive QR code rendering for mobile device scanning.\n  - **Waiting Room State**: An active waiting indicator for the room creator with instant copy-to-clipboard CTA while awaiting peer arrival.\n\n- **WebRTC Signaling & Production Architecture**:\n  - Synchronized WebRTC offer/answer signaling and ICE candidate routing between room initiator and joiner.\n  - Added `vercel.json` SPA rewrites and server-side route fallbacks for production deployment on Vercel."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
