  planner_response {
    response: "Maine aapki request ke anusaar saare extra features (stranger match, soundboard, whiteboard, voice filters, AI bot) hata diye hain aur app ko **Google Meet jaisa clean, anonymous aur End-to-End Encrypted (E2EE) video calling platform** bana diya hai:\n\n### \342\234\250 Key Features Implemented:\n\n1. **Google Meet Inspired Interface**:\n   - **Green Room & Landing Page**:\n     - **New Meeting**: Instant meeting start karne ka option ya future ke liye shareable link generate karne ka feature.\n     - **Enter Code or Link**: Google Meet style code/link input box.\n     - **Live Camera & Mic Preview**: Meeting join karne se pehle camera aur mic toggle, live voice speaking visualizer, aur device settings.\n     - **Anonymous Identity**: Zero-account setup \342\200\224 instant random pseudonym ya custom display name select karne ka option.\n\n2. **In-Call Experience (Google Meet Layout)**:\n   - **Video Stage**: Automatic dynamic grid view (Self + Peer) with speaking wave rings, mic mute badges, aur tile pin functionality.\n   - **Floating Bottom Control Dock**:\n     - \360\237\216\244 **Microphone**: Mute / Unmute\n     - \360\237\223\271 **Camera**: Turn on / off\n     - \360\237\226\245\357\270\217 **Present Now**: Full screen / window screen sharing\n     - \342\234\213 **Raise Hand**: In-call hand raise notification\n     - \342\232\231\357\270\217 **Audio & Video Settings**: Mic, camera, aur speakers switch karne ka modal\n     - \360\237\224\264 **Leave Call**: Red phone button to exit\n   - **Right-side Drawers**:\n     - \342\204\271\357\270\217 **Meeting Details**: 1-click copy meeting invite link aur E2EE details.\n     - \360\237\221\245 **People**: Connected participants list with real-time mic/camera status.\n     - \360\237\222\254 **In-Call Messages**: Ephemeral chat jo call khatam hone par automatically delete ho jata hai.\n\n3. **100% Anonymous & End-to-End Encrypted (E2EE)**:\n   - Koi login, registration ya personal data required nahi hai.\n   - Video, audio aur screen share direct peer-to-peer WebRTC (DTLS-SRTP) ke through encrypted rehte hain."
    thinking: "**Verifying User Intent**\n\nI\'ve meticulously cross-referenced the user\'s request. The instruction to strip all features except the core call functionality, emulating Google Meet\'s simplicity, along with the specification for an anonymous, end-to-end encrypted design, is completely understood. All auxiliary features are removed.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "Maine aapki request ke anusaar saare extra features (stranger match, soundboard, whiteboard, voice filters, AI bot) hata diye hain aur app ko **Google Meet jaisa clean, anonymous aur End-to-End Encrypted (E2EE) video calling platform** bana diya hai:\n\n### \342\234\250 Key Features Implemented:\n\n1. **Google Meet Inspired Interface**:\n   - **Green Room & Landing Page**:\n     - **New Meeting**: Instant meeting start karne ka option ya future ke liye shareable link generate karne ka feature.\n     - **Enter Code or Link**: Google Meet style code/link input box.\n     - **Live Camera & Mic Preview**: Meeting join karne se pehle camera aur mic toggle, live voice speaking visualizer, aur device settings.\n     - **Anonymous Identity**: Zero-account setup \342\200\224 instant random pseudonym ya custom display name select karne ka option.\n\n2. **In-Call Experience (Google Meet Layout)**:\n   - **Video Stage**: Automatic dynamic grid view (Self + Peer) with speaking wave rings, mic mute badges, aur tile pin functionality.\n   - **Floating Bottom Control Dock**:\n     - \360\237\216\244 **Microphone**: Mute / Unmute\n     - \360\237\223\271 **Camera**: Turn on / off\n     - \360\237\226\245\357\270\217 **Present Now**: Full screen / window screen sharing\n     - \342\234\213 **Raise Hand**: In-call hand raise notification\n     - \342\232\231\357\270\217 **Audio & Video Settings**: Mic, camera, aur speakers switch karne ka modal\n     - \360\237\224\264 **Leave Call**: Red phone button to exit\n   - **Right-side Drawers**:\n     - \342\204\271\357\270\217 **Meeting Details**: 1-click copy meeting invite link aur E2EE details.\n     - \360\237\221\245 **People**: Connected participants list with real-time mic/camera status.\n     - \360\237\222\254 **In-Call Messages**: Ephemeral chat jo call khatam hone par automatically delete ho jata hai.\n\n3. **100% Anonymous & End-to-End Encrypted (E2EE)**:\n   - Koi login, registration ya personal data required nahi hai.\n   - Video, audio aur screen share direct peer-to-peer WebRTC (DTLS-SRTP) ke through encrypted rehte hain."
