    thinking: "**Defining Media Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on identifying the necessary rich components for a robust media experience. I\'m starting with a deep dive into media rendering, file sharing, and lightboxes. The initial check involves components, such as `src/components/MediaViewerModal`. I plan to break down each function and its required components separately, as well as considering their overall design needs.\n\n\n**Expanding Media Interactions**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the specific interactive media components. I\'m thinking of a zoomable and rotatable lightbox for images, a video player with volume and scrub controls, and audio playback. Additionally, I\'m considering file-sharing features within the chat panel, including drag-and-drop support and a file attachment picker for various formats. Voice audio recording and media previews within the messages are next on my list.\n\n\n"
