  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the persistent chat and media sharing system with a 30-day (1-month) auto-deletion policy across the entire full-stack application:\n\n- **30-Day Auto-Purge & Retention Engine**:\n  - Engineered a server-side storage and background garbage collection routine that automatically and permanently unlinks files and purges chat records 30 days after posting.\n  - Added visual countdown badges and expiration indicators (`exp [date]`) on message envelopes and headers.\n\n- **Comprehensive Media & File Sharing**:\n  - **Images & Photos**: PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP preview with an interactive lightbox viewer (zoom, pan, rotate, download).\n  - **Videos**: MP4, WebM, MOV inline playback with custom responsive controls and full-screen support.\n  - **Voice Notes & Audio**: In-browser microphone voice recorder with live timer and playback player.\n  - **Documents & Files**: PDF, DOCX, ZIP, TXT, and source files with formatted size chips and direct download links.\n  - **Drag-and-Drop & Multi-upload Tray**: Drag files directly into the chat area or use the file attachment picker with multi-file staging.\n\n- **Real-Time Interactive Enhancements**:\n  - **Emoji Reactions**: Interactive reaction tray with live counts (`\342\235\244\357\270\217`, `\360\237\221\215`, `\360\237\224\245`, `\360\237\230\202`, `\360\237\216\211`, `\360\237\224\222`).\n  - **Live Typing Indicator**: Real-time broadcast showing when peers are composing messages.\n  - **Dual Access Modes**: Available both inside active video meetings (in-call side panel) and from the Lobby via the **Room Chat & File Hub** modal."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the persistent chat and media sharing system with a 30-day (1-month) auto-deletion policy across the entire full-stack application:\n\n- **30-Day Auto-Purge & Retention Engine**:\n  - Engineered a server-side storage and background garbage collection routine that automatically and permanently unlinks files and purges chat records 30 days after posting.\n  - Added visual countdown badges and expiration indicators (`exp [date]`) on message envelopes and headers.\n\n- **Comprehensive Media & File Sharing**:\n  - **Images & Photos**: PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP preview with an interactive lightbox viewer (zoom, pan, rotate, download).\n  - **Videos**: MP4, WebM, MOV inline playback with custom responsive controls and full-screen support.\n  - **Voice Notes & Audio**: In-browser microphone voice recorder with live timer and playback player.\n  - **Documents & Files**: PDF, DOCX, ZIP, TXT, and source files with formatted size chips and direct download links.\n  - **Drag-and-Drop & Multi-upload Tray**: Drag files directly into the chat area or use the file attachment picker with multi-file staging.\n\n- **Real-Time Interactive Enhancements**:\n  - **Emoji Reactions**: Interactive reaction tray with live counts (`\342\235\244\357\270\217`, `\360\237\221\215`, `\360\237\224\245`, `\360\237\230\202`, `\360\237\216\211`, `\360\237\224\222`).\n  - **Live Typing Indicator**: Real-time broadcast showing when peers are composing messages.\n  - **Dual Access Modes**: Available both inside active video meetings (in-call side panel) and from the Lobby via the **Room Chat & File Hub** modal."
