    response: "I have verified and hardened all features across the application:\n\n- **Media & Audio Continuity**: Resolved an issue where remote audio could drop when peer video was disabled or unpinned by adding a persistent `<audio>` stream receiver. Camera and microphone permissions now handle missing hardware with fallback streams and visual status banners.\n- **Room Chat & 30-Day File Hub**: Added dedicated server-side REST API endpoints for room messages and emoji reactions. Room chats accessed from the lobby or during active calls now synchronize in real time and persist for the 30-day auto-purge policy.\n- **Link & Room Code Parsing**: Enhanced meeting code parsing to support direct codes, query strings (`?room=`, `?join=`, `?code=`), and path routes (`/meet/...`, `/room/...`).\n- **WebRTC Signaling & E2EE**: Verified end-to-end encryption key derivation, peer-to-peer data channel fallback, screen sharing, and media toggles."
