    response: "I have resolved the errors and hardened the application\'s runtime stability:\n\n- **Safe Global Access & Fetch Guarding**:\n  - Implemented configurable accessor descriptor guards and global event filters in `index.html` to prevent strict-mode `TypeError` exceptions from sandbox wrappers or third-party extensions trying to rebind `fetch`.\n- **Callback & Signaling Stability**:\n  - Encapsulated WebRTC and socket event callbacks in mutable references (`onMatchedRef`, `onPeerDisconnectedRef`, `webrtcRef`) to eliminate stale closures when peers join or leave rooms.\n- **Audio Analyzer Optimization**:\n  - Added clean frame cancellation before initializing audio frequency level analyzers to avoid overlapping animation frame loops during mic toggling.\n- **Verification & Builds**:\n  - Verified TypeScript typing with zero errors and confirmed production build and development server status."
